_ce006_3_03_s_78","type":"Speech","speaker":"com","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_3_03_s_78","text":"Must ensure that their memories live on.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_3_03_s_79","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce006_02","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_3_03_s_79","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_3_03_s_80","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce006_02","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_3_03_s_80","text":"Hehe, what a sight. A bucket of bolts pontificating about carrying on memories.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_3_03_s_81","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce006_02","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_3_03_s_81","text":"Whether you reach your final decision here, or somewhere else, it has got nothing to do with me.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_3_03_s_82","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce006_02","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_3_03_s_82","text":"But if you're going to abandon the notion of revenge, you have to go all the way.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_3_03_s_83","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce006_02","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_3_03_s_83","text":"You must guard that data contained in that metal hunk of junk you call your body and keep it safe, until your creators rot and crumble to dust.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_3_03_s_84","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce006_02","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_3_03_s_84","text":"And then, however many hundreds or thousands of years later, you will stand upon their ashes triumphant, and laugh at them.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_3_03_s_85","type":"Speech","speaker":"com","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_3_03_s_85","text":"-----","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_3_03_s_86","type":"Speech","speaker":"com","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_3_03_s_86","text":"What---","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_3_03_s_87","type":"Speech","speaker":"com","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_3_03_s_87","text":"What did you do?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_3_03_s_88","type":"Speech","speaker":"com","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_3_03_s_88","text":"Did you decide to take revenge? Did you succeed?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_3_03_s_89","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce006_02","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_3_03_s_89","text":"... There was someone who opened my eyes and made me see the truth. If it weren't for them, I would still be living as a mindless slave to a God.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_3_03_s_90","type":"Speech","speaker":"com","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_3_03_s_90","text":"Did that person tell you how to get your revenge?","jump":null,"exit":f